### Task Nodes

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** | **Justification** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|-----------------------|---------------------|
| **AT1** | Retrieve order details from kitchen system | AND | kitchen | 1 | The robot must obtain the order before it can leave. |
| **AT2** | Check patient record for retrieval capability & companion presence | AND | hospital | 1 | Needed to decide whether a human will retrieve the food. |
| **AT3** | Transport meals from kitchen to inpatient room | AND | hospital | 1 | Core movement task. |
| **AT4** | Place meal on the room table (special manipulation) | AND | inpatient room | 1 | Requires the robot’s manipulation skill. |
| **AT5** | Leave meal on robot’s tray for patient to fetch | AND | inpatient room | 1 | Simpler hand‑over. |
| **AT6** | Indicate which meal should be retrieved by the patient | AND | inpatient room | 1 | Robot must communicate the correct meal. |
| **AT7** | Track retrieval time & location of each meal | AND | inpatient room | 1 | For audit and error detection. |
| **AT8** | Alert if wrong meal is retrieved | AND | inpatient room | 1 | Prevents patient confusion. |
| **AT9** | Retrieve dirty dishes unassisted (patient or companion) | AND | inpatient room | 1 | When the patient can pick them up. |
| **AT10** | Retrieve dirty dishes with another robot | AND | inpatient room | [2,2] | Two robots cooperate to lift heavy trays. |
| **AT11** | Retrieve dirty dishes with a human | AND | inpatient room | 1 | Human assists if needed. |
| **AT12** | Open door with a human (key or latch) | AND | room door | 1 | Human provides key or handles latch. |
| **AT13** | Open door with another robot | AND | room door | [2,2] | Two robots coordinate to push/turn the door. |

